  "Tubes sit outboard of the skid runner (the runner and legs fill the old tube centre line); buoyancy and draft are unchanged, the wider track adds roll stability.",
  "No pyrotechnics: a hand-cocked spring pulls the inflator lever when a 12 V latch solenoid releases it. Re-arm = new cylinder + re-cock, no explosive to store or ship.",
